<nav class="breadcrumbs" aria-label="Migas de pan"><a href="<?= e(url()) ?>">Portada</a><span>/</span><a href="<?= e(url('categoria/' . $article['category_slug'])) ?>"><?= e($article['category']) ?></a><span>/</span><span>Noticia</span></nav>
<article class="article-detail"><header class="article-header"><a class="category-label" href="<?= e(url('categoria/' . $article['category_slug'])) ?>"><?= e($article['category']) ?></a><h1><?= e($article['title']) ?></h1><p class="article-excerpt"><?= e($article['excerpt']) ?></p><div class="meta"><span>Por <?= e($article['author']) ?></span><time datetime="<?= e(date(DATE_ATOM, strtotime($article['published_at']))) ?>"><?= e(date('d/m/Y H:i', strtotime($article['published_at']))) ?></time></div><button class="button button--quiet js-only" id="reading-toggle" aria-pressed="false">Modo de lectura</button></header><figure class="article-image"><?php articleImage($article, true); ?><figcaption><?= e($article['image_alt']) ?> · Ilustración de referencia</figcaption></figure><div class="article-body"><?= App\Core\Sanitizer::html($article['content']) ?></div><footer class="article-end"><nav aria-label="Etiquetas de la noticia"><?php foreach ($tags as $tag): ?><a class="button button--quiet" href="<?= e(url('etiqueta/' . $tag['slug'])) ?>">#<?= e($tag['name']) ?></a><?php endforeach; ?></nav><div class="actions"><a class="button button--quiet" href="<?= e('https://www.facebook.com/sharer/sharer.php?u=' . rawurlencode($GLOBALS['config']['url'] . '/noticia/' . $article['slug'])) ?>" rel="noopener noreferrer">Compartir en Facebook</a><a class="button button--quiet" href="<?= e('https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?url=' . rawurlencode($GLOBALS['config']['url'] . '/noticia/' . $article['slug']) . '&text=' . rawurlencode($article['title'])) ?>" rel="noopener noreferrer">Compartir en X</a></div></footer></article>
<section class="comments-section" id="comentarios" aria-labelledby="comments-title"><h2 id="comments-title">Conversación</h2><p>Los comentarios se revisan antes de publicarse. Dialoga con respeto.</p><?php errorSummary($errors); ?><?php if ($user && $user['role'] === 'lector'): ?><?php $_SESSION['comment_form_time'] ??= time(); ?><form method="post" action="<?= e(url('noticia/' . $article['slug'] . '/comentar')) ?>"><?= csrf() ?><div class="field"><label for="content">Tu comentario (obligatorio, máximo 1000 caracteres)</label><textarea name="content" id="content" required maxlength="1000" rows="5"<?= isset($errors['content']) ? ' aria-invalid="true" aria-describedby="error-content"' : '' ?>><?= e($data['content'] ?? '') ?></textarea><?php if (isset($errors['content'])): ?><p id="error-content" class="field-error"><?= e($errors['content']) ?></p><?php endif; ?></div><div class="honeypot" aria-hidden="true"><label for="website">Deja este campo vacío</label><input name="website" id="website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"></div><button class="button">Enviar a moderación</button></form><?php elseif (!$user): ?><a class="button" href="<?= e(url('login')) ?>">Inicia sesión para comentar</a><?php else: ?><p>Para comentar usa una cuenta de lector. Los editores y administradores moderan desde el panel.</p><?php endif; ?>
<?php foreach ($comments as $comment): ?><article class="comment"><h3><?= e($comment['name']) ?></h3><time datetime="<?= e(date(DATE_ATOM, strtotime($comment['created_at']))) ?>"><?= e(date('d/m/Y', strtotime($comment['created_at']))) ?></time><p><?= e($comment['content']) ?></p></article><?php endforeach; ?><?php if (!$comments): ?><p>Todavía no hay comentarios aprobados. Puedes iniciar la conversación.</p><?php endif; ?></section>
<section aria-labelledby="related-title"><div class="section-heading"><h2 id="related-title">También te puede interesar</h2></div><div class="cards-grid"><?php foreach ($related as $item): ?><?php require __DIR__ . '/card.php'; ?><?php endforeach; ?></div></section>
